{
  "id": "pick-skip-clicks",
  "description": "Fewer Mouse Picks When Still, pick correctness: the mouse is aimed (agent screenpos, the camera pointed at each target first) at the selected Sim, the nearest mailbox and the ground beside the Sim, held still 6 s, the game's hover pick read (agent pick) and checked (a Sim, an object, ground; the Sim and the mailbox by name), then 3 left clicks on it (Esc after each). Then the still-mouse case: the mouse rests 6 s above a ground point 3 m from the selected Sim, the Sim walks there (Go Here) and the hover pick must turn into the Sim within 20 s. Every pick is compared with the off loads of the run (-AB). Pass: same picks off and on, on logs clicks held for a new pick with 0 timed out and picks skipped while still, off logs no skip line.",
  "save": "ApexTest-Town",
  "toml": {
    "ui": {
      "developer_mode": true
    }
  },
  "variants": {
